1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:06,150
Replay plays the market back candle by candle, so you can practise or check an idea.

2
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:09,010
A replay bar opens under the chart. First pick where the replay starts.

3
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:12,220
Click the candle to start from.

4
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:15,580
Everything after that candle is hidden.

5
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:21,440
Play adds the next candles one by one.

6
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:24,450
Click it again to pause.

7
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:30,280
This button moves forward one candle at a time.

8
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:35,210
Choose how fast it plays.

9
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:41,840
Now it plays three times faster.

10
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:47,360
This arrow can also start from a date, the first candle, or a random one.

11
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:53,800
The X ends the replay and brings back the live chart.

